  m_Name: AlienQueen
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  exhibitName: Alien Queen
  description: "The Alien Queen is a very large and dangerous creature in the game
    ARK: Survival Evolved, found in the Aberration map. It looks like a mix between
    a dinosaur and an alien, and it lives deep underground in dark, radioactive areas.
    The Reaper Queen cannot be tamed like normal creatures. Instead, it uses a special
    method: it \u201Cimpregnates\u201D the player with a baby Reaper, which later
    grows into a powerful creature called a Reaper King. \n\nPlayers need special
    protective suits to survive in the places where Reaper Queens live. They are
    very strong and hard to defeat, so you must be well-prepared. Once you raise
    the baby Reaper King, it becomes one of the strongest creatures in the game,
    great for fighting and exploring dangerous areas. The Reaper Queen is inspired
    by the alien monsters from the Alien movies, which makes it one of the most exciting
    and scary creatures in ARK. "
  images: []
